                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">Each time an enemy unit is selected to fight, melee weapons equipped by models in that unit have the [HAZARDOUS] ability while targeting the bearer’s unit.</characteristic>
